.SH "نام (NAME)"
po4a-display-pod \- display of a translated POD file according to a PO
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBpo4a\-display\-pod\fR\ 'u
\fBpo4a\-display\-pod\fR \fB\-p\ \fR \fIPO_FILE\fR \fB\-m\ \fR \fIPOD_FILE\fR [\fB\-o\ \fR\ \fIPO4A_OPT\fR]
.br

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Translators can use
\fBpo4a\-display\-pod\fR
to see how their translation of a man page will be rendered to the end users, without recompiling and reinstalling the whole project\&. Most of the time, the POD file is only available in source package or embedded in Perl script\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-p \fR\fIPO_FILE\fR
.RS 4
The PO file containing the translations\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-m \fR\fIPOD_FILE\fR
.RS 4
The original POD file used by po4a to generate PO file\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-o \fR\fIPO4A_OPT\fR
.RS 4
Some options to pass to
\fBpo4a-translate\fR(1)\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBpo4a-display-man\fR(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
Florentin Duneau
